{"term":{"label":"心","occurrences":15,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"1A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-i","title":"梁惠王上","description":"孟子見梁惠王。王曰：「叟不遠千里而來，亦將有以利吾國乎？」\n孟子對曰：「王何必曰利？亦有仁義而已矣。王曰『何以利吾國』？大夫曰『何以利吾家』？士庶人曰『何以利吾身』？上下交征利而國危矣。萬乘之國弒其君者，必千乘之家；千乘之國弒其君者，必百乘之家。萬取千焉，千取百焉，不為不多矣。苟為後義而先利，不奪不饜。未有仁而遺其親者"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"人","id":"人"},{"form":"何","id":"何"},{"form":"保","id":"保"},{"form":"勝","id":"勝"},{"form":"國","id":"國"},{"form":"妻","id":"妻"},{"form":"寡","id":"寡"},{"form":"後","id":"後"},{"form":"心","id":"心"},{"form":"恆","id":"恆"},{"form":"敵","id":"敵"},{"form":"時","id":"時"},{"form":"殺","id":"殺"},{"form":"用","id":"用"},{"form":"見","id":"見"},{"form":"足","id":"足"}],"edges":[{"weight":0.4803664162812822,"source":"保","target":"人"},{"weight":1.4611956692930084,"source":"保","target":"寡"},{"weight":1.7125100975739145,"source":"保","target":"用"},{"weight":1.4611956692930084,"source":"保","target":"見"},{"weight":1.2605249738308573,"source":"保","target":"足"},{"weight":2.048982334195127,"source":"保","target":"妻"},{"weight":1.8384899004344764,"source":"人","target":"寡"},{"weight":0.8858315243894465,"source":"人","target":"心"},{"weight":0.8370413602200144,"source":"人","target":"用"},{"weight":2.0898043287153825,"source":"人","target":"殺"},{"weight":0.8370413602200144,"source":"人","target":"勝"},{"weight":1.1247234326717954,"source":"用","target":"寡"},{"weight":1.019362917013969,"source":"用","target":"心"},{"weight":2.0691850415126467,"source":"用","target":"勝"},{"weight":1.7125100975739145,"source":"用","target":"時"},{"weight":1.8178706132317408,"source":"用","target":"見"},{"weight":2.6775909936175015,"source":"恆","target":"心"},{"weight":0.5673777932709119,"source":"足","target":"心"},{"weight":1.9536721543908024,"source":"足","target":"妻"},{"weight":1.4611956692930084,"source":"敵","target":"寡"},{"weight":0.7139812674627873,"source":"敵","target":"何"},{"weight":0.6186710876584623,"source":"國","target":"何"},{"weight":0.672738308928